          "body": "Brent,\nWe are aware of the problem and are planning to address it the next release,\ncurrently planned as 2.1. with HttpClient 2.0 you can still work the problem\naround by turning off automatic redirects and handling redirects manually.\n\nOleg\n\n*** This bug has been marked as a duplicate of 10790 ***",
